<object id="scope" label="PurchaseInvoiceLine.AccrualJournalEntryID points to the estimate; GoodsReceiptLineID is absent on this service path. An invoice below estimate may leave a residual accrual.&#xa;Later Accrual Adjustment journals use reversal links; they do not have to wait for AP cash payment. Residual-aging reconciliation is a proposed teaching control, not a stored workflow queue." bpmnType="heading" ><mxCell style="html=0;fontFamily=Arial;fontSize=14;fontColor=#152b35;strokeColor=#196252;strokeWidth=1.5;fillColor=#FFFFFF;whiteSpace=wrap;text;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;fontSize=13;align=left;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="847" width="1800" height="48" as="geometry"/></mxCell></object></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>
